return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:13+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:13+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Oʻzingizning WordPress saytingizdan Zinn Digital® xostingini soting — WordPress, WooCommerce, agentlik, dilerlik (reseller), bulutli va VPS xostinglari. Dilerlik hisobingizdan domenlarni qidiring hamda taklif qiling, mijozlaringizni toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri ularning xosting paneliga kiring va WooCommerce buyurtmasi toʻlanganda xostingni avtomatik tarzda taqdim eting.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Xosting platformasi %d holati bilan javob berdi.','Find your domain name'=>'Domen nomingizni toping','Search'=>'Qidirish','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Ushbu nom uchun hech qanday kengaytmalar tekshirilmadi.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Ushbu saytda domen qidiruvi ayni vaqtda mavjud emas.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Hozir domen reestriga ulanib bo‘lmadi. Iltimos, birozdan so‘ng qayta urinib ko‘ring.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.'=>'API kaliti mavjud emas yoki endi haqiqiy emas. Uni Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit rukni ostida tekshiring.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Ushbu API kaliti domen qidiruvi uchun zarur boʻlgan sites.view ruxsatiga ega emas. Uni sotuvchi panelingizdagi kalitga qoʻshing yoki ommaviy qidiruvga qaytish uchun kalitni bu yerdan tozalang.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Buni faqat administratorlar koʻradi:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Buni tekshirib boʻlmadi — qaytadan urinib koʻring','Already registered'=>'Roʻyxatdan oʻtgan','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Mavjud — narxini bizdan soʻrang','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Mavjud — birinchi yil uchun %1$s %2$s','Register it'=>'Uni roʻyxatdan oʻtkazing','Manage my hosting'=>'Xostingimni boshqarish','Please sign in first.'=>'Iltimos, avval tizimga kiring.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Ushbu hisob hali hech qanday hosting xizmatiga ulanmagan.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Xosting platformasi tizimga kirish havolasini qaytarmadi.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Reseller asboblar toʻplami','Account'=>'Hisob','Features'=>'Xususiyatlar','Styling'=>'Uslub berish','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Sunʼiy intellekt agentlari (MCP)','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI agentlariga (MCP) ruxsat berish','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Oʻchiq: quyidagi vositalar va ularning REST marshrutlari umuman roʻyxatdan oʻtmagan.','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Sizning Zinn Digital® dilerlik hisobingiz','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Zinn® boshqaruv panelingizda Dasturchi → API kalitlari bo‘limida qayta sotuvchi API kalitini yarating va uni shu yerga joylashtiring.','Reseller API key'=>'Reseller API kaliti','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'Faqat ushbu saytda saqlanadi hamda hech qachon eksport yoki diagnostika hisobotiga kiritilmaydi.','Plan to provision'=>'Taqdim qilinadigan tarif','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Yangi mijozlar biriktiriladigan tarif rejasi kodi. Har safar soʻralishi uchun boʻsh qoldiring.','API address'=>'API manzili','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Agar Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati sizdan buni o‘zgartirishni so‘ramagan bo‘lsa, bunga tegmang.','Control-panel address'=>'Boshqaruv paneli manzili','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'"Mening xostingim" havolasi mijozlaringizni yoʻnaltiradigan joy.','Domain search'=>'Domen qidirish','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'[zinn_domain_search] qisqa kodini kiriting','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarga domenni tekshirish va uni siz orqali sotib olish imkonini berish uchun qisqa kodni istalgan sahifaga joylashtiring.','Panel link'=>'Panel havolasi','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Tizimga kirgan mijozlarga "Mening hostingim" havolasini koʻrsatish','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'WooCommerce ta’minoti','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'WooCommerce buyurtmasi bajarilganda hostingni avtomatik ravishda taqdim eting','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Faqat siz Zinn® rejasiga biriktirgan mahsulotni oʻz ichiga olgan buyurtmalarga nisbatan amal qiladi.','Domain search appearance'=>'Domen qidiruvi koʻrinishi','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Ushbu vidjet oʻzingizning mavzuingiz ichida aks etadi. Tayyor sozlamani tanlang yoki oʻz ranglaringizni belgilang — har ikki holatda ham sahifalaringizga tashrif buyuruvchi bizniki deb koʻra oladigan hech narsa qoʻshilmaydi.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'Vidjet foydalanadigan har bir sinf plaginning readme faylida keltirilgan, shuning uchun dasturchi oldindan oʻrnatilgan sozlama qamrab olmagan har qanday narsani bekor qila oladi.','Follow my theme'=>'Mavzuimga ergashing','Soft'=>'Yumshoq','High contrast'=>'Yuqori kontrast','Compact'=>'Ixcham','Buy-link colour'=>'Xarid havolasi rangi','“Available” colour'=>'"Mavjud" rangi','“Could not check” colour'=>'“Tekshirib boʻlmadi” rangi','Error colour'=>'Xato rangi','Corner rounding'=>'Burchaklarni yumaloqlash','Space inside each row'=>'Har bir qator ichidagi boʻsh joy','Text size'=>'Matn hajmi','Domain-name weight'=>'Domen nomi vazni','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Hozircha sotuvchi API kaliti yo‘q.','Domain search already works without one, at the public prices. The panel link and WooCommerce provisioning need a key: create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys.'=>'Domen qidiruvi allaqachon usiz ham ochiq narxlarda ishlaydi. Panel havolasi va WooCommerce taʼminoti uchun kalit kerak: Zinn® boshqaruv panelingizdagi Dasturchi → API kalitlari boʻlimida uni yarating.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Zinn® boshqaruv panelimni oching','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'Kalit oʻrnatilgan, ammo hech narsa yoqilmagan.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Uchta xususiyatning hech biri yoqilmagan, shuning uchun bu plagin saytingizda hech narsa qilmayapti. Xususiyatlar boʻlimidan kerakli narsalarni yoqing.','Open Features'=>'Xususiyatlarni ochish','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'Tayyor — %d ta funksiya yoqildi.' . "\0" . 'Tayyor — %d ta funksiya yoqildi.','Selling from'=>'Sotish joyi','Settings'=>'Sozlamalar','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Hali API kaliti yoʻq, shuning uchun hech narsa ulanmagan.','Not connected: %s'=>'Ulanmagan: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'Ulandi. Sizning dilerlik dasturingiz: %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Hech qanday Zinn® API kaliti sozlanmagan, shuning uchun hech narsa taqdim etilmadi.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Ushbu buyurtmada domen nomi kiritilmagan, shuning uchun taqdim qilinadigan hech narsa yoʻq edi.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Xosting platformasi hech qanday saytni qaytarmadi.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'%1$s uchun Zinn® xostingi taqdim etildi (xizmat %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Xosting platformasi mijoz hisobini qaytarmadi.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Zinn® xostingi ajratilmadi: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Zinn® mahsulotlar qatori','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Ushbu mahsulot sotib olinganda taqdim etiladigan Zinn® mahsulotlar liniyasi. Plagin sozlamalaridagi birlamchi qiymatdan foydalanish uchun boʻsh qoldiring.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Zinn® xostingi','Service id'=>'Xizmat identifikatori','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Ushbu buyurtma uchun hech narsa taqdim etilmagan.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Saqlandi. Uni almashtirish uchun yangi qiymat kiriting.','Filter this list…'=>'Ushbu roʻyxatni saralash…','Filter this list'=>'Ushbu roʻyxatni saralash','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Ushbu filtrga hech narsa mos kelmaydi.','Add a row'=>'Qator qoʻshish','Remove this row'=>'Ushbu qatorni olib tashlang','Remove'=>'Olib tashlash','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — umumiy koʻrinish','Overview'=>'Umumiy koʻrinish','Copied'=>'Nusxalandi','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Ushbu saytdagi har bir Zinn® plagini va uning ishlayotganligi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ushbu plagin uchun hech qanday ulanish talab qilinmaydi.','Open settings'=>'Sozlamalarni ochish','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Sizda ushbu sozlamalarni oʻzgartirish uchun ruxsat yoʻq.','Settings sections'=>'Sozlamalar boʻlimlari','Support'=>'Qoʻllab-quvvatlash','Save changes'=>'Oʻzgarishlarni saqlash','Tools'=>'Asboblar','Export settings'=>'Sozlamalarni eksport qilish','Reset to defaults'=>'Birlamchi holatga qaytarish','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Bu ushbu plaginning barcha sozlamalarini standart holatiga qaytaradi. Davom ettirasizmi?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Yordam xizmati uchun diagnostika','Import a settings file'=>'Sozlamalar faylini import qilish','Import'=>'Import qilish','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Eksport qilingan fayllarda hech qachon parollar, tokenlar yoki API kalitlari boʻlmaydi — ularni yangi saytda qayta kiritishingiz kerak boʻladi.','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Ushbu plaginning barcha sozlamalari asl holatiga qaytarildi.','Done.'=>'Bajarildi.','That action is not available.'=>'Bu amal mavjud emas.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ushbu faylni oʻqib boʻlmadi. Zinn® plaginidan eksport qilingan sozlamalar faylini tanlang.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Bu fayl sozlamalar eksporti boʻlishi uchun juda katta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Ushbu fayl Zinn® sozlamalari eksporti emas.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Ushbu fayl boshqa plagin (%s) orqali eksport qilingan, shuning uchun uni bu yerga import qilish ushbu plagin tushunmaydigan sozlamalarni saqlaydi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari hech qachon eksport tarkibida bo‘lmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qayta kiriting.' . "\0" . '%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari hech qachon eksport tarkibida boʻlmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qayta kiriting.','Connected'=>'Ulandi','Connecting…'=>'Ulanmoqda…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ulandi, ammo nimadir eʼtibor talab qiladi','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Running on your own account'=>'Oʻzingizning hisobingizda ishlamoqda','We could not check this'=>'Buni tekshirib boʻlmadi','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Ushbu plagin sababini aytmadi. Diagnostika hisobotini yuboring va biz koʻrib chiqamiz.','Connection status'=>'Ulanish holati','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Oxirgi marta %s oldin tekshirilgan.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yangi varaqda ochiladi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Buni Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuboring','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Aynan mana shu narsa yuboriladi — boshqa hech narsa yoʻq va yashirin hech narsa yoʻq. Parollaringiz, tokenlaringiz va API kalitlaringiz bu yerda mavjud emas.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Yuboriladigan diagnostika hisoboti','Copy to clipboard'=>'Vaqtinchalik xotiraga nusxalash','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Ushbu hisobotni Zinn® yordam xizmatiga yuboring','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Siz uchun yordam so‘rovini ochamiz va elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz. Agar uni yuborishni istamasangiz, yuqoridan nusxa oling va uni o‘zingiz so‘rovga joylashtiring.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ushbu serverdan (%s) Zinn Digital® bilan bogʻlanib boʻlmadi. Yuqoridagi hisobotdan nusxa oling va uning oʻrniga chipta oching — sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xatolik yoʻq.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Yuborildi. Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati hisobotingizni qabul qildi va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Yuborildi. Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati hisobotingizni oldi — havola %s — va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Qisqa vaqt ichida bir nechta hisobot yubordingiz. Bir necha daqiqa kuting va qayta urinib koʻring — oldingilari yetib bordi.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® hozircha hisobotni qabul qila olmadi — bu biz tomonimizdagi muammo, sizda emas. Birozdan soʻng qayta urinib koʻring yoki yuqoridagi hisobotni chiptaga nusxalang.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Hisobot rad etildi (HTTP %d). Uni yuqoridan nusxalang va ushbu raqamni koʻrsatgan holda chipta oching.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qoʻllanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmasini oʻqing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul koʻchirish va bittadan ortiq saytni boshqaradiganlar uchun yaratilgan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Har ikki tomon rozi boʻlguniga qadar mablagʻ xavfsiz saqlangan holda, faoliyat yuritayotgan saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishlarini xarid qiling hamda soting.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — bu ish bilan professional shugʻullanadigan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilans bozorimiz: yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini koʻrib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtiring va ularga narx taklif qilishlariga ruxsat bering.','Style preset'=>'Uslub andozasi','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Boshlangʻich nuqta. Quyidagi har qanday narsa uning oʻrnini egallaydi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Oʻzimning ranglarim va oʻlchamlarimdan foydalanish','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Buni oʻchiq qoldiring va andoza xuddi bor holatida ishlatiladi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® reliz qaydlarini koʻring.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® yangilash xizmati ushbu yangilanish uchun yuklab olish havolasini taqdim etmadi. Ushbu sayt Zinn® platformasiga ulana olishini tekshiring, soʻng qayta urinib koʻring.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Yangilanishni Zinn® yangilanish xizmatidan (%s) yuklab boʻlmadi. Bir necha daqiqadan soʻng yana urinib koʻring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan oʻtmadi va oʻrnatilmadi.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Amalni bajarib bo‘lmadi. Qaytadan urinib ko‘ring va agar xatolik takrorlanaversa, sayt administratori bilan bog‘laning.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Kerakli qiymat mavjud emas yoki notoʻgʻri shaklda. Qobiliyatning kiritish sxemasini (input schema) tekshiring.','The site refused the request.'=>'Sayt soʻrovni rad etdi.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Claude, Cursor yoki VS Code kabi sunʼiy intellekt yordamchilariga MCP (Model Context Protocol) orqali ushbu saytda siz uchun ishlashiga ruxsat bering. Ular dastur paroli orqali WordPress foydalanuvchisi sifatida tizimga kiradilar va faqat ushbu foydalanuvchiga ruxsat berilgan amallarni bajara oladilar.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'AI agentlari uchun WordPress 6.9 yoki undan keyingi versiyasi talab qilinadi. Ulardan foydalanish uchun WordPress-ni yangilang.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Ulanish manzili (MCP oxirgi nuqtasi)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Foydalanuvchingiz uchun ilova parolini yarating','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Buni foydalanuvchi nomingiz va oʻsha parol bilan AI ilovangizning MCP sozlamalariga qoʻshing:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: bir xil yozuvni .vscode/mcp.json faylida "mcpServers" ostiga emas, "servers" ostiga qoʻying.','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Sunʼiy intellekt agenti bu yerda foydalanishi mumkin boʻlgan vositalar (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmasi: AI agentlari va MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dasturchilar hujjati: qobiliyatlar, REST va MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'Ushbu saytdan Zinn Digital® dagi hosting mijozlaringizni, ularning tariflarini va saytlarini boshqaring.','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'Zinn Digital® sotuvchi hisobingiz orqali mijozlaringiz, ularning rejalari va ularning saytlari.','Read your reseller account'=>'Reseller hisobingizni o‘qing','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'Reseller hisobingizni bitta oʻqishda qaytaradi: brend, rejalar, mijozlar va xizmatlar soni hamda nimalar sozlanganligi.','List your clients'=>'Mijozlaringizni roʻyxatga oling','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'Mijoz hisoblaringizni har safar bittadan sahifada roʻyxatlaydi (cursor, limit).','Create a client'=>'Mijoz yaratish','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'Hisobingiz ostida mijoz hisobini yaratadi (name; default_currency, uch harfli kod). Birinchi saytlaridan oldin ularni tarif rejasiga biriktiring.','Read a client\'s plan'=>'Mijoz tarifini o‘qish','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'Mijoz qaysi tarif rejasida ekanligini va bu sizga qanchaga tushishini qaytaradi (client_id).','Put a client on a plan'=>'Mijozni tarifga biriktiring','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'Mijozni rejalaringizdan biriga biriktiradi (client_id, plan_code; interval: month yoki year). Buni ularning birinchi saytidan oldin bajaring.','List the plans you can sell'=>'Sotishingiz mumkin bo\'lgan rejalarni ro\'yxatlang','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'Xosting rejalari va ularning narxlarini sanab oʻtadi (product_line va currency uni toraytiradi).','List your clients\' sites'=>'Mijozlaringiz saytlari roʻyxatini koʻrsatish','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'Mijozlaringiz uchun taqdim etgan barcha narsalarni (client_id va status uni toraytiradi), bir vaqtning oʻzida bitta sahifadan roʻyxatlaydi.','Create a site for a client'=>'Mijoz uchun sayt yarating','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'Mijozlaringizdan biri uchun xosting qilingan sayt yaratadi (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). Bu sizning do‘koningizdan bo‘lgani kabi, mijozning tarifi bo‘yicha hisobingizga yoziladi.','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'Mijoz saytini toʻxtatib turish','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'Mijoz saytini toʻlov amalga oshirilmaganligi sababli toʻxtatib turish holatiga oʻtkazadi (site_id; sabab: oʻzingizning eslatmangiz, mijozga hech qachon koʻrsatilmaydi). Sayt faoliyati toʻxtatilish bekor qilinmaguncha toʻxtatiladi.','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'Mijoz saytining bloklanishini bekor qilish','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'To‘lov qilinmaganligi sababli qo‘yilgan cheklovni olib tashlaydi, natijada sayt yana ishlay boshlaydi (site_id).','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Reseller Toolkit sozlamalarini oʻqish','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Ushbu plagin sozlamalarini qaytaradi (API manzili, yangi buyurtmalar foydalanadigan tarif rejasi, qaysi funksiyalar yoqilganligi). API kaliti hech qachon qaytarilmaydi, faqat uning saqlangan yoki saqlanmaganligi koʻrsatiladi.','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Reseller Toolkit sozlamalarini oʻzgartiring','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'Siz yuborgan sozlamalarni (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) oʻzgartiradi va qolganlarini saqlab qoladi. API kaliti va manzil faqat ekranda oʻzgartiriladi.','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'Avval Reseller Toolkit ekranida Zinn Digital® sotuvchi API kalitingizni qoʻshing.']];